DEPRECATION_TARGETS
- Delete alert-rule fields/surfaces: conditions, RuleConditionTree, msg_template, notify_channels, type, threshold, changed_to, changed_from, ==, contains, is_true, is_false, and RuleBuilder import/export once Alert Studio is typed-only.
- Reject API severity "warning" on writes; persist "warn" and let UI display "Warning" if desired.
- Replace /alerts/test msg_template with message and route delivery through enabled notification channels.
- Remove automation create/import/export legacy JSON bodies: trigger_config, root conditions, root actions, notify flags/notify_channels arrays, builder Record<string, unknown> state, and legacy type discriminators after typed CTI save/load exists.

